{"availability":"available","full":"akhil-dara/CVAurum","name":"CVAurum","description":"Free, open-source, 100% local résumé builder. 75 ATS-ready templates, a deterministic ATS score, PDF résumé import with on-device OCR, and archival vector PDF (PDF/A-2B + PDF/UA-1), Word and JSON Resume export — no account, no server, no tracking, fully offline.","category":"Design","language":"TypeScript","stars":17,"forks":8,"created":"2026-06-14T18:05:43Z","updated":"2026-09-28T02:14:54Z","license":"AGPL-3.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://cvaurum.com","topics":["applicant-tracking-system","ats","ats-resume","cv","cv-builder","json-resume","local-first","offline-first","pdf","privacy","pwa","react","resume","resume-builder","resume-maker","resume-parser","resume-template","tailwindcss","typescript","vite"],"demo":"https://cvaurum.com/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-05T19:22:14.463Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-05T19:22:14.463Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-05T19:22:14.463Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-05T19:22:14.463Z","stars":17,"forks":8}],"technologies":["React"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Build a beautiful, ATS-ready resume in your browser. 100% local, private, and free. No account. No server. No tracking.","A resume tool should be beautiful, private, and instant — without asking you to sign up, pay, or trust a server with your career history. CVAurum is built around four ideas:"],"features":["🎨 Design-first. 75 hand-crafted templates — including a thirteen-design Signature collection where the page itself is rebuilt (a numbered running head, a poster block, a band of figures read from your own content, a…","🔒 Private by architecture. There is no backend. Your data lives only in your browser. Nothing is ever uploaded, logged, or tracked — and even sharing is an AES-256 encrypted link that never touches a server.","⚡ Instant, keyboard-first. One command to start. Edit directly on the resume, drive everything from a ⌘K command palette, type / for quick inserts, and watch a live ATS score update as you type.","📄 Fully accessible, archival PDFs. Every PDF is drawn by CVAurum's own vector engine — the only export path there is, with no print-dialog fallback behind it — and every export is PDF/A-2B (archival) and PDF/UA-1…","♿ A contrast checker that fixes, not just flags. While you edit, the page measures every run of text against what it actually stands on (bands, gradients, art, cards) and shows a WCAG AA chip over the page. When a…"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/akhil-dara/CVAurum/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"6a4d495471ffb27033cb1c22d53948d696e80a9dea6b7cd87855c00d945a38ab","extractedAt":"2026-10-05T19:22:14.634Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-05T19:22:14.634Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Build a beautiful, ATS-ready resume in your browser. 100% local, private, and free. No account. No server. No tracking.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/akhil-dara/CVAurum/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"not_required","text":"Pick from 75 premium templates — thirteen of them a Signature collection, where each design is a different page structure rather than a recolour — edit right on the page, get instant ATS feedback, tailor your resume to a job description, import an existing PDF résumé, and export a crisp PDF (drawn by CVAurum's own vector engine, byte-for-byte the page you were looking at) or…","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/akhil-dara/CVAurum/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"documented","text":"No server, no account, no analytics, no tracking, no cookies. (More in Privacy.)","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/akhil-dara/CVAurum/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"6a4d495471ffb27033cb1c22d53948d696e80a9dea6b7cd87855c00d945a38ab","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/akhil-dara/CVAurum/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-05T19:22:14.635Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-09-28T02:14:54Z","readmeSnaps